      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Players can understand the multiple values of animals through interaction
        and decision-making. They can learn about the ecological impact of animals
        in nature by targeting them, and also understand how humans utilize these
        animal resources by shooting them.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
